import ../../helpers/driver.dl
import lib/text_scan.dl

appearance source appearance:
    font size is 16
    padding is 12
    height is 140

document composition test:
    editor "Source" containing "Aé🙂B\nC" using source appearance

set instance to an instance of composition test
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 300 by 240 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set source to view's selection's caret source
set view's selection's anchor to 1
set view's selection's caret to 7
set view's damaged to true
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set epoch to view's input context's epoch
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 2.0 2.0 with modifiers 2 containing "東京" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's input context's bounds' x = 36.0) reporting "The source prefix shifted its composition caret twice"
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 4.0 4.0 with modifiers 2 containing "東京\n語" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set layout to the UI layout labeled "Source" in (view's layout)
require condition (layout's content = "A東京\n語B\nC") reporting "Composition did not replace its selected presentation range"
require condition (source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC") reporting "Tentative composition changed the source"
set recorded to (view's window as a pointer to test UI surface)'s drawn
require condition ((recorded contains "東京") and (recorded contains "語")) reporting "Multiline composition was not painted"
require condition ((recorded contains "é🙂") = false) reporting "The selected source remained under its preedit"
require condition (view's input context's line = 1) reporting "The native composition caret lost its presented source line"
require condition (view's input context's prefix width = 8.0) reporting "The native composition caret ignored its tentative text"
require condition (view's input context's epoch = epoch) reporting "Tentative composition invalidated its native input session"
set entry to the UI value for (source's element) in (the address of instance)
require condition (entry's undo = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI text edit)) reporting "Tentative composition created an undo entry"
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 13 key epoch at 5.0 5.0 with modifiers 0 containing "A東京\n語B\nC" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((source's text = "A東京\n語B\nC") and (view's selection's caret = 11)) reporting "A committed composition lost its Unicode caret"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 90 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 2 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((source's text = "Aé🙂B\nC") and (view's selection's anchor = 1)) reporting "Composition undo did not restore its original source and selection"
set epoch to view's input context's epoch
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 1 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 10 key epoch at 1.0 1.0 with modifiers 2 containing "仮" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
set the text of "Source" in (the address of instance) to "replacement"
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's selection's composing = false) reporting "Replacing a document retained its old composition"
queue UI input of kind 13 key epoch at 1.0 1.0 with modifiers 0 containing "old composition" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (source's text = "replacement") reporting "An old native composition overwrote its replacement document"
close the address of view
close the address of instance
print line "Composition presents Unicode replacements without changing source or undo until commit."
